{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060615/block/singleImage/3250296/wm/01M5YJY7RTYF27V9G50FF5DA46.jpeg?updatedAt=1793101763\"/><figcaption>VICTORIA COAST目前累售20伙，套現逾5.6億元。</figcaption></figure><p>華懋集團旗下薄扶林域多利道豪宅項目「 VICTORIA COAST 」最新以招標形式售出 1 伙，為 A 座 14 樓單位 2 ，屬兩房一套連工作間戶型，實用面積 1,367 方呎，成交價 2,730 萬元，呎價約 19,971 元。 據悉，買家為外籍客，追求南區恬靜優尚生活，鍾情單位之寬敞間隔及坐擁南區全海景，預計將作自住用途。 發展商表示，「 VICTORIA COAST 」於 1 個月內持續錄得成交，反映優質臨海豪宅持續獲市場追捧。項目目前累售 20 伙，套現逾 5.6 億元。 即睇薄扶林 Victoria Coast 最新資訊 (House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T13:41:58.171930+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":313,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T12:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T20:38:10.333317+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T13:38:34.173966+00:00","content_hash":"38e31c132bf3b1f0fdce4e9e0d20d5cadbc009fcfe98fe6da0b905f73d0d8ef1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T13:41:58.171930+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}